@@ -263,3 +263,5 @@ The same design round, continued after #25. Ralph, with a Sourcetree screenshot:
 - 2026-11-14 (Story 10.33) — the app follows #26 for the diff options and whitespace: the menu is the diff header's last control (`ZsMenuButton` with a new icon-only form and `active`, `packages/zanshin_ui`; `diffOptionsEntries` in `inspector_diff.dart`), in the inspector and the operation view; whitespace is `GeneralSettings.diffWhitespace` (also a Settings › General › Diffs row), context lines jj's `diff.color-words.context` at user scope. While whitespace is ignored the focused file is read exact and at `-b` / `-w`; `whitespaceRows` turns lines that changed only in whitespace into the `-w` read's context, folds a whitespace-only part into the hatched row with its checkbox and Show, and shows a picked or opened part's lines dimmed with the "whitespace only" pill (· Hide while only opened); a file left with no hunk reads "Only whitespace changed in this file." In the DS `MenuButton` gains `iconOnly` / `active` / `label` (`.is-icon`, `.is-active`, card *MenuButton*), `DiffView` the `options` menu and `onlyWhitespace` note, `DiffHunk` `ws` lines, `{ t: "fold", n }` rows, `onShow` / `onHide` (`content.css`, card *Content*); `_ds_bundle.js` by hand. Not published (the DS artifact and the canvas wait for Story 10.38's ledger item).
 
 - 2026-11-15 (Story 10.40) — fixes from Ralph's first use, no new look: the unified diff's pinned numbers, gutter, fold and no-newline pins and hunk header paint on an opaque base (`Color.alphaBlend(codeBg, flBgSolid)`, `inspector_diff.dart`); a click outside an open menu, in its own anchor area too, closes it and is consumed, so a `ZsMenuButton` click on its open button closes it (`zs_menu.dart`); Split with every change picked shows only its hint and Cancel; a line past the end of the file on disk opens the file at its start with a note; the diff options menu reads the workspace's context lines and notes when the repo config sets them. In the DS `MenuButton` opens its menu above the button when there is no room below, as `ZsMenuButton` does (`MenuButton.jsx` / `.d.ts` / `.prompt.md`, `_ds_bundle.js` by hand with its `sourceHashes`). Not published (waits for a console session).
+
+- 2026-11-15 (Story 10.41) — the app follows the Whitespace Study (Ralph's two changes of 2026-11-15): while whitespace is ignored each exact hunk shows the ignoring read's lines (`diffBlocks` / `diffBlockRows` in `inspector_diff.dart`; the backend's new `FileDiff.whitespace_lines` lists every line that changed only in whitespace, with jj's marks), whitespace-only lines are marked and never dimmed, lines `jj diff -w` skips sit in a gap row with Show / Hide ("N more lines with only whitespace changes" / "N lines with only whitespace changes"), a whitespace-only part keeps its hatched fold row with its checkbox, and any pick opens the gaps without Hide. The header keeps the exact range, its counts are the ignoring rows'; the header pill and the "whitespace only" pill are gone. In the DS `DiffHunk` takes `{ t: "gap", n, open, fixed }` rows and open folds, drops `ws` lines (`content.css`, card *Content*, `_ds_bundle.js` by hand with its `sourceHashes`). Not published (waits for a console session).
